#!name=Claude All Services Proxy v3 (2026-10-10)
#!desc=Maximal Claude/Anthropic overlay: iOS, web, desktop, Code, Artifacts, auth, telemetry, supported third parties. Shared-service traffic may also be proxied; no MITM.
#!author=ChatGPT

# IMPORT: disable earlier Claude modules, enable this module; active policy PROXY must exist.
# NOTES: Includes non-iOS related services and third-party shared domains deliberately.
# IMPORTANT: Domain routes on the phone cannot govern Anthropic server-side tool egress.
# WARNING: Wide Google/GitHub/Stripe/Microsoft/connector rules also redirect other apps.
# IP 160.79.104.0/21 is officially OUTBOUND-only; included only for maximal request, not required by Claude iOS.
# NTP is deliberately excluded: NTP supplies UTC; it does not reveal system timezone.

[Rule]

# --- Anthropic / Claude primary and branded ecosystem (including all v2) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.ai,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.app,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claude.dev,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,clau.de,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.io,PROXY
DOMAIN,anthropic.auth0.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,anthropic.com.cdn.cloudflare.net,PROXY
DOMAIN,servd-anthropic-website.b-cdn.net,PROXY
DOMAIN,anthropic-com.ghost.io,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,anthropic,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,claude,PROXY

# --- Statsig SDK / experiment and fallback endpoints (official Statsig inventory) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,statsigapi.net,PROXY
