DOMAIN-SUFFIX,prodregistryv2.org,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,beyondwickedmapping.org,PROXY
DOMAIN,api.statsig.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,api.statsigcdn.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,console.statsig.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,cdn.console.statsig.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,console.statsigcdn.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,events.statsigapi.net,PROXY
DOMAIN,cloudflare-dns.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,idliststorage.blob.core.windows.net,PROXY
DOMAIN,cdn.growthbook.io,PROXY

# --- Crash monitoring / anti-fraud / analytics / customer support ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sentry.io,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,datadoghq.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,datadoghq.eu,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sift.com,PROXY
