DOMAIN-KEYWORD,datadog,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,sentry,PROXY
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,sift,PROXY

# --- Authentication / anti-bot / sign-in (some hosts are shared) ---
DOMAIN,challenges.cloudflare.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,accounts.google.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,oauth2.googleapis.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,accounts.googleusercontent.com,PROXY
DOMAIN,apis.google.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleapis.com,PROXY
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,googleusercontent.com,PROXY
